  - id: n_open_promised
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: n_check
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "あ、この間、手伝うと言ってくれた方ですね！ミケのこと、何か分かりましたか。"
    textReading: "あ、このあいだ、てつだうといってくれたかたですね！ミケのこと、なにかわかりましたか。"
    textVi: "À, là người hôm trước đã hứa giúp tôi phải không! Bạn có biết được gì về Mike chưa?"
    textEn: "Ah, you're the one who promised to help me the other day! Have you found out anything about Mike?"
    textRomaji: "A, kono aida, tetsudau to itte kureta kata desu ne! Mike no koto, nanika wakarimashita ka."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_open_new
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: n_check
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "あの…すみません。うちの猫が、まだ見つからないんです。"
    textReading: "あの…すみません。うちのねこが、まだみつからないんです。"
    textVi: "À... xin lỗi bạn. Con mèo nhà tôi vẫn chưa tìm thấy."
    textEn: "Ah... sorry. My cat still hasn't been found."
    textRomaji: "Ano... sumimasen. Uchi no neko ga, mada mitsukaranai n desu."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_check
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: 
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "猫について、何か分かりましたか。"
    textReading: "ねこについて、なにかわかりましたか。"
    textVi: "Bạn đã tìm được manh mối gì về chú mèo chưa?"
    textEn: "Have you found any clues about the cat?"
    textRomaji: "Neko ni tsuite, nanika wakarimashita ka?"
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - textJa: "公園の近くで見ました。"
      textVi: "Tôi đã thấy nó gần công viên."
      textEn: "I saw her near the park."
      nextNodeId: b_where_hint
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Grammar
        value: 10
        reason: "Mô tả vị trí bằng mẫu 〜の近くで見ました"
      grammarTags:
      - grammar.n5.no_chikaku_de
      - grammar.n5.mashita
      vocabularyTags:
      - vocab.n5.kouen
      setFlags: []
    - textJa: "猫は公園です。"
      textVi: "Con mèo là công viên."
      textEn: "The cat is the park."
      nextNodeId: n_correction
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Grammar
        value: -8
        reason: "Câu vô nghĩa: mèo không thể 'là' công viên; cần dùng mẫu mô tả vị trí"
      grammarTags: []
      vocabularyTags: []
      setFlags: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_correction
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: n_check
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "場所を言うときは、「〜の近くで見ました」と言うと自然ですよ。もう一度、どうぞ。"
    textReading: "ばしょをいうときは、「〜のちかくでみました」というとしぜんですよ。もういちど、どうぞ。"
    textVi: "Khi nói vị trí, dùng mẫu \"~ no chikaku de mimashita\" (đã thấy gần ~) sẽ tự nhiên hơn. Mời bạn nói lại."
    textEn: "When talking about a place, \"~ no chikaku de mimashita\" (I saw it near ~) sounds more natural. Please say it again."
    textRomaji: "Basho wo iu toki wa, \"~ no chikaku de mimashita\" to iu to shizen desu yo. Mou ichido, douzo."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: b_where_hint
    nodeType: 7
    nextNodeId: n_where_park
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: 
    speakerId: 
    textJa: 
    textReading: 
    textEn: 
    textRomaji: 
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: "cat.shrine_hint"
    flagJumpNodeId: n_where_shrine
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_where_shrine
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: n_detail_after
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "神社の近くですか。前に、ミケはそこが好きだと言いましたね。"
    textReading: "じんじゃのちかくですか。まえに、ミケはそこがすきだといいましたね。"
    textVi: "Gần đền thờ à. Lúc trước tôi có nói Mike thích chỗ đó nhỉ."
    textEn: "Near the shrine. I told you before that Mike likes it there, didn't I?"
    textRomaji: "Jinja no chikaku desu ka. Mae ni, Mike wa soko ga suki da to iimashita ne."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_where_park
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: n_detail_after
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "公園ですか。そういえば、ミケは公園にもよく行きますね。"
    textReading: "こうえんですか。そういえば、ミケはこうえんにもよくいきますね。"
    textVi: "Công viên à. À phải rồi, Mike cũng hay đi công viên nhỉ."
    textEn: "The park. Oh right, Mike often goes to the park too."
    textRomaji: "Kouen desu ka. Souieba, Mike wa kouen ni mo yoku ikimasu ne."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_detail_after
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: 
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "どんな猫でしたか？"
    textReading: "どんなねこでしたか？"
    textVi: "Đó là một chú mèo như thế nào?"
    textEn: "What kind of cat was it?"
    textRomaji: "Donna neko deshita ka?"
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - textJa: "小さくて、白い猫でした。"
      textVi: "Đó là một chú mèo nhỏ, màu trắng."
      textEn: "It was a small white cat."
      nextNodeId: n_ask_ribbon
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Grammar
        value: 10
        reason: "Nối hai tính từ đuôi い bằng dạng 〜くて: 小さくて"
      grammarTags:
      - grammar.n5.te_form_adj
      vocabularyTags:
      - vocab.n5.chiisai
      - vocab.n5.shiroi
      setFlags: []
    - textJa: "白いと小さい猫でした。"
      textVi: "Một chú mèo trắng và nhỏ."
      textEn: "A white and small cat."
      nextNodeId: n_adjective_hint
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Grammar
        value: -4
        reason: "Nối hai tính từ đuôi い phải đổi thành dạng 〜くて (小さくて), không dùng と"
      grammarTags: []
      vocabularyTags: []
      setFlags: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_adjective_hint
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: n_detail_after
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "い形容詞をつなぐ時は「小さくて」と言いますよ。もう一度、どうぞ。"
    textReading: "いけいようしをつなぐときは「ちいさくて」といいますよ。もういちど、どうぞ。"
    textVi: "Khi nối tính từ đuôi い, hãy nói \"chiisakute\" nhé. Mời bạn nói lại."
    textEn: "When joining い-adjectives, say \"chiisakute\". Please say it again."
    textRomaji: "I-keiyoushi wo tsunagu toki wa \"chiisakute\" to iimasu yo. Mou ichido, douzo."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: point
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_ask_ribbon
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: 
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "そうです、ミケです！首に、赤いリボンをしていましたか。"
    textReading: "そうです、ミケです！くびに、あかいリボンをしていましたか。"
    textVi: "Đúng rồi, chính là Mike! Nó có đeo chiếc nơ đỏ ở cổ không?"
    textEn: "That's right, that's Mike! Was she wearing a red ribbon on her neck?"
    textRomaji: "Sou desu, Mike desu! Kubi ni, akai ribon wo shite imashita ka?"
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - textJa: "はい、赤いリボンをしていました。"
      textVi: "Vâng, nó có đeo một chiếc nơ đỏ ạ."
      textEn: "Yes, she was wearing a red ribbon."
      nextNodeId: n_direction
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Grammar
        value: 10
        reason: "Xác nhận đúng chi tiết bằng thì quá khứ 〜していました"
      grammarTags:
      - grammar.n5.te_imashita
      vocabularyTags:
      - vocab.n5.ribon
      setFlags:
      - cat.described
    - textJa: "覚えていません。"
      textVi: "Tôi không nhớ rõ."
      textEn: "I don't remember well."
      nextNodeId: n_direction
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: ResponseAccuracy
        value: 3
        reason: "Trả lời thành thật nhưng thiếu chi tiết quan trọng"
      grammarTags: []
      vocabularyTags:
      - vocab.n5.oboeru
      setFlags: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_direction
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: 
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "公園のどちら側ですか。"
    textReading: "こうえんのどちらがわですか。"
    textVi: "Nó ở phía nào của công viên?"
    textEn: "Which side of the park was she on?"
    textRomaji: "Kouen no dochira gawa desu ka?"
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - textJa: "コンビニの向かい側です。"
      textVi: "Ở phía đối diện cửa hàng tiện lợi ạ."
      textEn: "On the side across from the convenience store."
      nextNodeId: n_thanks
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Grammar
        value: 10
        reason: "Mô tả vị trí tương đối bằng 〜の向かい側です"
      grammarTags:
      - grammar.n5.no_mukaigawa
      vocabularyTags:
      - vocab.n5.konbini
      setFlags:
      - cat.direction_given
    - textJa: "コンビニの中です。"
      textVi: "Ở bên trong cửa hàng tiện lợi ạ."
      textEn: "Inside the convenience store."
      nextNodeId: n_verify
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: ResponseAccuracy
        value: -3
        reason: "Vị trí không hợp lý: mèo hoang không ở trong cửa hàng, dễ gây hiểu nhầm"
      grammarTags: []
      vocabularyTags: []
      setFlags: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_verify
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: 
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "お店の中ではなく、向かい側ですね？"
    textReading: "おみせのなかではなく、むかいがわですね？"
    textVi: "Không phải bên trong cửa hàng, mà là phía đối diện đúng không ạ?"
    textEn: "Not inside the store, you mean across from it, right?"
    textRomaji: "Omise no naka dewa naku, mukaigawa desu ne?"
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - textJa: "はい、向かい側です。"
      textVi: "Vâng, phía đối diện ạ."
      textEn: "Yes, across from it."
      nextNodeId: n_thanks
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: ResponseAccuracy
        value: 7
        reason: "Xác nhận lại đúng vị trí"
      grammarTags: []
      vocabularyTags: []
      setFlags:
      - cat.direction_given
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_thanks
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: n_go
    objectiveIdToComplete: obj_report_cat_clue
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "助かりました。一緒に探してくれて、ありがとうございます。"
    textReading: "たすかりました。いっしょにさがしてくれて、ありがとうございます。"
    textVi: "Bạn giúp tôi nhiều lắm. Cảm ơn vì đã cùng tôi tìm kiếm."
    textEn: "You've helped me so much. Thank you for searching with me."
    textRomaji: "Tasukarimashita. Issho ni sagashite kurete, arigatou gozaimasu."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: bow
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_go
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: n_recap
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "今から、向かい側を見に行きます。あなたも、良かったら来てください。"
    textReading: "いまから、むかいがわをみにいきます。あなたも、よかったらきてください。"
    textVi: "Bây giờ tôi sẽ đi xem phía đối diện. Nếu tiện thì bạn cùng đi nhé."
    textEn: "I'll go and look across the way now. Come with me if you can."
    textRomaji: "Ima kara, mukaigawa wo mi ni ikimasu. Anata mo, yokattara kite kudasai."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_recap
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: node_complete
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: 
    speakerId: 
    textJa: "今日のポイント：「〜の近くで見ました」「小さくて、白い」「〜の向かい側です」。"
    textReading: "きょうのポイント：「〜のちかくでみました」「ちいさくて、しろい」「〜のむかいがわです」。"
    textVi: "Tóm tắt: \"~ no chikaku de mimashita\" (đã thấy gần ~), nối tính từ đuôi い bằng 〜くて, \"~ no mukaigawa desu\" (ở phía đối diện ~)."
    textEn: "Summary: \"~ no chikaku de mimashita\" (I saw it near ~), joining い-adjectives with 〜くて, \"~ no mukaigawa desu\" (it's across from ~)."
    textRomaji: "Kyou no pointo: \"~ no chikaku de mimashita\" \"chiisakute, shiroi\" \"~ no mukaigawa desu\"."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
